6112 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Hexens is a pioneering cybersecurity firm dedicated to establishing robust security standards for Web3 infrastructure\054 driving secure mass adoption through innovative protection technology and frameworks\056 As an industry elite experts in blockchain security\054 we deliver comprehensive audit solutions across specialized domains\054 including infrastructure security\054 Zero Knowledge Proof\054 novel cryptography\054 DeFi protocols\054 and NFTs\056\nOur methodology combines industry\055standard security practices combined with unique methodology of two teams per audit\054 continuously advancing the field of Web3 security\056 This innovative approach has earned us recognition from industry leaders\056\nSince our founding in 2021\054 we have built an exceptional portfolio of enterprise clients\054 including major blockchain ecosystems and Web3 platforms\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 6113 0 R
     /Pg 598 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

