6119 0 obj
  << /ActualText (This audit covers Ledig Protocol\054 an on\055chain\054 fully collateralised stablecoin call\055options protocol for emerging\055market foreign\055exchange use cases\056 It is designed for institutions that want to lock access to a USD stablecoin against another stablecoin at a fixed rate before a stated expiry\056 \nThe review was conducted over a week and included a comprehensive analysis of the relevant smart contracts\056\nDuring the assessment\054 we did not identify any major issues\056 We identified one low\055severity finding and four informational issues\056\nAll identified issues were either remediated or acknowledged by the development team and subsequently verified by our auditors\056\nFollowing the remediation phase\054 we conclude that the protocol\047s overall security posture and code quality have improved as a result of this audit\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 6120 0 R
     /Pg 724 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

