  << /ActualText (The OptionSeriesV2\056exercise\050\051 function allows the buyer to exercise their option\056 It iterates through all reserved writers in the order of the reservedWritersByBuyer array \050first\055fill\054 first\055served\051 and settles each writer atomically\056 During settlement\054 the buyer transfers the Strike asset to the writer\054 while the Base asset is transferred from the vault to the writer\056)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 6321 0 R
     /Pg 2800 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
